== check m05_extra_at.hero
error[marker_mismatch]: a function value does not change this argument — the `@` says it does
  at m05_extra_at.hero:10:18
     |
  10 |     print(fs[0](@x))  #~ marker_mismatch
     |                  ^
  note: no function type carries an `@` (§ 9), so a value is always called with plain arguments; a function that changes its argument is called by name, `f(@x)`
check exit 1
